Subject: moonlight-01-behavior
Why: Host-display CLI, Tailscale QHostAddress, headless pair, ECLIPSE_CONTROL hotkeys, fill-client window, Eclipse-styled display-map overlay, splash hold.
Depends-on: vendor/PINS moonlight-qt; apply before moonlight-02-ui.patch

